BEGIN_REGISTER
CLEAR
PRINT  -- New Hacknet User Registration --
END_REGISTER

BEGIN_NAME_EN
GETINPUT  USERNAME : 
END_NAME_EN

BEGIN_NAME_CHT
GETINPUT  使用者名稱 : 
END_NAME_CHT

BEGIN_PASSWD_EN
GETINPUTPWD  PASSWORD : 
END_PASSWD_EN

BEGIN_PASSWD_CHT
GETINPUTPWD  密碼 : 
END_PASSWD_CHT

BEGIN_CONFIRM_EN
GETINPUTPWD  CONFIRM PASS : 
END_CONFIRM_EN

BEGIN_CONFIRM_CHT
GETINPUTPWD  確認密碼 : 
END_CONFIRM_CHT

BEGIN_DETAILS_EN
PRINT   -- Details Confirmed --
PRINT  WARNING : Once created, a session's language cannot be changed
PRINT  READY - PRESS ENTER TO CONFIRM
PRINT  --------------------------------------------------------
PRINT  ____________________
PRINT  | Confirm          |
PRINT  ‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾
PRINT  ____________________
PRINT  | Cancel           |
PRINT  ‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾
GETINPUTNUL
END_DETAILS_EN

BEGIN_DETAILS_CHT
PRINT   -- 資訊已確認 --
PRINT  警告 : 一旦創建，該存檔的語言無法再更改
PRINT  準備好了 - 按下 ENTER 來確認
PRINT  --------------------------------------------------------
PRINT  ____________________
PRINT  | Confirm          |
PRINT  ‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾
PRINT  ____________________
PRINT  | Cancel           |
PRINT  ‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾
GETINPUTNUL
END_DETAILS_CHT

BEGIN_USEDNAME
PRINT This name already used!
WAIT 3
END_USEDNAME

BEGIN_INVCONFIRM
PRINT Invalid to confirm password!
WAIT 3
END_INVCONFIRM

BEGIN_RESERVED
PRINT The name is reserved in this system!
WAIT 3
END_RESERVED